・売買フローの推定（AI）</div><div class=\"discnote\">この銘柄は本日の分析対象外です（今夜の厳選・出尽くしサイン・レーティング変化・注目開示などの注目銘柄のみ、毎晩の実行で場中の5分足を取得して分析します）。</div><div class=\"spwrap\"><div class=\"nhead\">値動きと長期支持帯<span class=\"spbtns\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"spbtn\" onclick=\"spSwap(this, '1')\">1年</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"spbtn on\" onclick=\"spSwap(this, '3')\">3年</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"spbtn\" onclick=\"spSwap(this, '10')\">10年</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"spbtn\" onclick=\"spSwap(this, 'all')\">全期間(27年)</button></span></div><div class=\"spark spv\" data-sp=\"1\" style=\"display:none\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 320 110\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" style=\"width:100%; height:auto; background:#fffdf6; border-radius:8px;\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"74.4\" width=\"320\" height=\"5.099999999999994\" fill=\"#c62f2f\" opacity=\"0.12\"/><polyline points=\"4.0,97.2 9.1,89.6 14.2,90.2 19.3,89.8 24.5,95.9 29.6,94.1 34.7,87.1 39.8,66.0 44.9,68.1 50.0,76.8 55.1,68.8 60.3,62.7 65.4,59.3 70.5,54.7 75.6,56.2 80.7,67.5 85.8,59.7 91.0,52.7 96.1,54.6 101.2,60.0 106.3,43.7 111.4,63.9 116.5,63.5 121.6,69.1 126.8,74.8 131.9,82.0 137.0,81.2 142.1,72.3 147.2,65.9 152.3,58.6 157.4,40.3 162.6,44.1 167.7,30.4 172.8,30.8 177.9,12.8 183.0,25.4 188.1,27.5 193.2,51.9 198.4,36.9 203.5,23.8 208.6,45.7 213.7,41.4 218.8,53.4 223.9,50.1 229.0,51.6 234.2,51.4 239.3,43.2 244.4,59.8 249.5,58.0 254.6,68.4 259.7,68.8 264.9,68.6 270.0,71.5 275.1,74.7 280.2,73.7 285.3,70.2 290.4,66.9 295.5,66.0 300.7,64.0 305.8,74.9 310.9,78.4 316.0,76.8\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#1c1c1e\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/><path d=\"M 239.3 55.2 l 5 8 l -10 0 z\" fill=\"#c62f2f\"/><path d=\"M 275.1 86.7 l 5 8 l -10 0 z\" fill=\"#c62f2f\"/><circle cx=\"316.0\" cy=\"76.8\" r=\"4\" fill=\"#1c1c1e\"/></svg></div><div class=\"spark spv\" data-sp=\"3\" style=\"display:\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 320 110\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" style=\"width:100%; height:auto; background:#fffdf6; border-radius:8px;\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"55